TextMate grammars and themes
----------------------------

Workdeck uses TextMate-compatible grammars compiled into syntect and embeds the exact 65 Shiki
theme payloads selected by Hunk plus Pierre's two default themes. Individual grammar and theme
authors retain their respective copyright and license notices.

Shiki theme source package: tm-themes 1.12.0
Hunk-pinned semantic oracle: @shikijs/themes 3.23.0
License: MIT plus each source theme's permissive license
Complete notices: third_party/themes/tm-themes-LICENSE and
third_party/themes/tm-themes-NOTICE

Pierre default theme source package: @pierre/theme 2.0.0
License: Apache-2.0 with Primer MIT attribution
Complete notices: third_party/themes/pierre-theme-LICENSE and
third_party/themes/pierre-theme-NOTICE.md

The release archives retain these complete notice files. The asset manifest records the fixed
source-archive and generated-file SHA-256 digests. Release SBOM and dependency-license outputs
enumerate the exact Rust packages used to load and execute the themes and grammars.

